  "intro": {
    "key": "Networks between VMs: each VM in a network gets a second network card there and reaches the network's other VMs – NixOS and macOS alike, e.g. a Docker VM for several macOS VMs. Its own network (SSH, the internet) stays as it is. A change counts from the VM's next start.",
